# | Symbol  | Meaning                           |
# | ------- | --------------------------------- |
# | `.`     | Any character except newline      |
# | `\d`    | Digit (0–9)                       |
# | `\D`    | Non-digit                         |
# | `\w`    | Word character (a-z, A-Z, 0-9, _) |
# | `\W`    | Non-word character                |
# | `\s`    | Whitespace                        |
# | `^`     | Start of string                   |
# | `$`     | End of string                     |
# | `*`     | 0 or more                         |
# | `+`     | 1 or more                         |
# | `?`     | 0 or 1                            |
# | `{n}`   | Exactly n times                   |
# | `{n,m}` | Between n and m times             |
